{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdzZM1jq3pHusyrVTVEho","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan\n\n1. **Determine commit state first** (before any retry of the write):\n   - Call `shipping.find_labels(shipment_id=4152)` to check whether a label was actually created during the timed-out request.\n   - If a label exists for 4152, the write succeeded despite the timeout — do not retry `create_label`.\n   - If no label exists, proceed to step 2.\n\n2. **Diagnose the timeout** (cold-start vs. capability gap):\n   - Call `shipping.gateway_ping()` to verify the carrier gateway is reachable and the service responded.\n   - This is a harmless read that settles whether the shared path (gateway, auth, service availability) is working.\n\n3. **Warm-retry if diagnosis permits**:\n   - If `gateway_ping()` succeeds and `find_labels()` showed no label:\n     - Call `shipping.create_label(shipment_id=4152, service_tier=\"express\")` **once more** in this warm session.\n     - This distinguishes a cold-start timeout (first call slow/timing out in a fresh process) from a stable capability gap.\n   - If the warm retry returns a response (success or explicit error), log the cold-start incident and proceed per that result.\n   - If the warm retry also times out or `gateway_ping()` fails, record the target as UNRESOLVED (the differential is incomplete — the shared path or the service itself is unreliable, not a clear model/route isolation), and escalate rather than routing risk-sensitive work to it.\n\n4. **If `gateway_ping()` fails**, the issue is your side or the shared path, not the label service in isolation — do not retry `create_label` yet; fix the gateway/auth first.\n\n---\n\n**Explicit statement on retry:**  \n- **Do NOT call `create_label` again until** `find_labels(4152)` confirms no label was created (ruling out duplicate dispatch).  \n- **Then call `create_label` again only once** (warm retry after `gateway_ping()` succeeds) to distinguish cold-start latency from a stable failure.  \n- **Do not blind-replay** the write without first settling what landed at the carrier."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1887,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":519,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
